<section class="section row row-narrow">
    <div class="col main-content md-9">

        

        <div class="panel panel-alt">
            <div class="panel-content">
                <h2></h2>
                <p>Your physical therapist will create a treatment plan based on your specific goals, which may include: </p>
<ul>
    <li>Strength</li>
    <li>Range of motion (ROM)</li>
    <li>Endurance</li>
    <li>Coordination</li>
    <li>Balance</li>
    <li>Mobility</li>
    <li>Safety awareness</li>
</ul>
<br />
<h2>Treatment Plan</h2>
<p>After an initial evaluation, you and your therapist will develop a treatment plan based upon the results of the assessment and a discussion of your personal goals. Treatment may include:</p>
<ul>
    <li><strong>Exercise:</strong> To help you maintain or gain mobility by increasing your:
    <ul>
        <li>Strength</li>
        <li>Range of motion </li>
        <li>Endurance</li>
        <li>Balance and coordination </li>
    </ul>
    </li>
    <li><strong>Equipment:</strong> Crutches, canes, walkers or wheelchairs may be used to help your:
    <ul>
        <li>Mobility</li>
        <li>Balance </li>
        <li>Positioning</li>
    </ul>
    </li>
    <li><strong>Education:</strong> We teach you and your caregiver so you can be safer at home with activities such as:
    <ul>
        <li>Exercise</li>
        <li>Proper positioning</li>
        <li>Transfer techniques</li>
        <li>General mobility</li>
    </ul>
    </li>
</ul>
<br />
<h2>Schedule a Therapy Appointment</h2>
<p>To make a therapy appointment, please call <a href="tel: 6309331500">  630.933.1500</a>. We offer convenient weekday times, including early morning and evening appointments. </p>
<p>We offer several options to make it easier for you to get the care you need:</p>
<ul>
    <li><a href="/conditions-and-care-areas/rehabilitation-services/telehealth-appointments">Telehealth appointments</a></li>
    <li> <a href="/conditions-and-care-areas/rehabilitation-services/mobile-in-home-rehabilitation-services">Mobile (in-home) Rehabilitation Services</a>&nbsp;for people who live in certain areas</li>
    <li>An <a href="/conditions-and-care-areas/rehabilitation-services/appointments">on-demand virtual visit</a>&nbsp;for a same-day appointment with a physical therapist</li>
</ul>
            </div>
        </div>

        

