    <div id="telehealth-rehabilitation-services" class="card card-callout card-general bordered">
        <div class="card-flex card-border">
                <div class="card-image-wide">
                    <img src="/-/media/northwestern/images/care-areas/rehabilitation-services/northwestern-medicine-woman-stretching.jpeg?la=en&amp;h=4501&amp;w=6752&amp;hash=304D20D02C82261FB97C4460D19E3124" alt="a woman watching a laptop screen while sitting o the floor and stretching on leg outward" />
                </div>
            <div class="card-content ">

               

                        <div class="h4">Telehealth Rehabilitation Services</div>

                    <div class="card-content-body ">
                        <p>We offer a program that can give you early access to physical therapy evaluation and care through telehealth appointments. You may be eligible for this program if you have:</p>
<ul>
    <li>Back, knee or hip pain</li>
    <li>Tight or weak muscles</li>
    <li>Joint aches and pain</li>
</ul>
                    </div>

          
            </div>

                <div class="card-action ">
<a href="/conditions-and-care-areas/rehabilitation-services/telehealth-appointments" >                        <span class="material-icons" aria-hidden="true">arrow_forward</span>
Schedule An Appointment</a>                </div>

        </div>
    </div>


